{"unit_id":"Crosery__dsh-drop#card-zh","repo":"Crosery/dsh-drop","commit":"0d8d54dee115a5cbb468dc7b970c13ec1710d1d0","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Drop（DSH 插件，Web 与桌面客户端）：把拖放或粘贴的文件和文件夹加入会话输入区，并在发送时附上可供模型读取的路径引用。它接入 DSH 的浏览器输入界面，提供共享预览栏、图片预览、文件与文件夹暂存，以及发送前的路径插入。已有本机路径且通过确认时会原地引用；否则将副本写入 DSH 主机的 drops 日期目录。文件夹复制会按文件数、总字节数和深度限制检查，超限时整项拒绝。适合需要把本地资料交给 DSH 会话读取的用户；不需要 API Key 或第三方账号。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:275"]}
{"unit_id":"Crosery__dsh-drop#card-en","repo":"Crosery/dsh-drop","commit":"0d8d54dee115a5cbb468dc7b970c13ec1710d1d0","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Drop (a Web and desktop DSH plugin) adds dropped files and folders to DSH sessions. It previews images and appends file paths when sending. Confirmed local paths are referenced in place; other items are copied to the DSH host. Folder copies have size limits. No key or account is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:275"]}
