{"unit_id":"Crosery__dsh-drop#feature-1","repo":"Crosery/dsh-drop","commit":"0d8d54dee115a5cbb468dc7b970c13ec1710d1d0","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Drop 的功能「文件与图片预览」：拖放或粘贴内容进入共享预览栏；图片显示缩略图，其他文件按格式提供预览或信息卡。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/DropRail.tsx:510"]}
{"unit_id":"Crosery__dsh-drop#feature-2","repo":"Crosery/dsh-drop","commit":"0d8d54dee115a5cbb468dc7b970c13ec1710d1d0","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Drop 的功能「发送时附加文件路径」：已暂存的文件不会提前改动草稿；发送时才把路径引用插入消息，等待中的采集会阻止不完整发送。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/submit-guard.ts:1"]}
{"unit_id":"Crosery__dsh-drop#feature-3","repo":"Crosery/dsh-drop","commit":"0d8d54dee115a5cbb468dc7b970c13ec1710d1d0","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Drop 的功能「原路径引用或复制暂存」：桌面路径或经主机确认的路径会原地引用；没有可用路径时上传文件副本并返回暂存路径。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/acquire.ts:161"]}
{"unit_id":"Crosery__dsh-drop#feature-4","repo":"Crosery/dsh-drop","commit":"0d8d54dee115a5cbb468dc7b970c13ec1710d1d0","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Drop 的功能「文件夹作为单个引用」：拖入文件夹后按结构遍历；原路径可用时直接引用，否则在限制内批量上传并作为一个文件夹路径发送。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/folder-acquire.ts:160"]}
{"unit_id":"Crosery__dsh-drop#feature-5","repo":"Crosery/dsh-drop","commit":"0d8d54dee115a5cbb468dc7b970c13ec1710d1d0","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Drop 的功能「文件夹上传进度与限制」：文件夹卡片展示处理进度；超过文件数、大小或深度限制时整份拒绝，移除卡片可取消采集。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:310"]}
{"unit_id":"Crosery__dsh-drop#caveat-1","repo":"Crosery/dsh-drop","commit":"0d8d54dee115a5cbb468dc7b970c13ec1710d1d0","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Drop 使用原路径或将副本写入 DSH 主机的 $DSH_HOME/drops 日期目录；未发送的待处理条目只保存在当前页面，刷新后需要重新拖入。（见 src/client/acquire.ts:171）","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/acquire.ts:171"]}
{"unit_id":"Crosery__dsh-drop#caveat-2","repo":"Crosery/dsh-drop","commit":"0d8d54dee115a5cbb468dc7b970c13ec1710d1d0","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"没有原路径时，文件内容会复制到 DSH 主机的本地暂存目录；文件夹复制会跳过配置的名称并受大小、数量和深度限制。（见 src/client/folder-acquire.ts:160）","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/folder-acquire.ts:160"]}
